	evaluate a prior schema-v1 review JSON (a file path, or - for stdin) instead of running a review

.PP
\fB-h\fP, \fB--help\fP[=false]
	help for guard

.PP
\fB--policy\fP=".commitbrief/policy.yml"
	path to the policy file

.PP
\fB--unstaged\fP[=false]
	run-mode: review the unstaged working tree instead of the staged index


